# Line endings.
#
# Without this file the repository stores LF while a Windows checkout holds
# CRLF, so the same working tree reads as clean on Windows and as a hundred
# modified files from Linux or macOS. Normalizing here settles it for every
# contributor and for CI.
#
# `text=auto` lets git detect text and store it as LF. `eol=lf` also checks it
# out as LF on every platform, which matters for benchmarks/tracking/openfoam
# where Allrun is a shell script and the dictionaries are read by OpenFOAM on
# Linux; CRLF breaks both.
* text=auto eol=lf

# PLOT3D grid and solution files are unformatted binary. Never transform them.
*.x  binary
*.q  binary

# Other binary formats.
*.png binary
*.pdf binary
